WEBVTT

00:00:01.280 --> 00:00:08.360
Our mission is to gather the Seven Mermaid Princesses and seven pearls to summon forth Aqua Regina-sama.

00:00:08.630 --> 00:00:11.410
We're feeling a bit relieved since Karen joined our side,

00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:15.700
but Karen's twin sister, Noelle, is still trapped in Gaito's lair.

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:19.360
But we're never, ever going to lose to them!

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:24.310
All right! Today again with our Pichi Pichi Voices, it's Live Start!

00:02:08.620 --> 00:02:12.470
Yo. What are you up to, Hanon? Being at this place...

00:02:12.470 --> 00:02:14.830
Can't you tell by looking, Rina?

00:02:15.990 --> 00:02:18.850
Stirring a brown unknown substance around slowly...

00:02:18.850 --> 00:02:20.080
Are you playing with mud?

00:02:20.080 --> 00:02:21.670
No!!

00:02:21.670 --> 00:02:23.630
I'm making chocolate!

00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:27.540
It's not that I dislike sweet things...

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:28.800
I'm sorry, Hanon.

00:02:28.800 --> 00:02:32.210
When you went through the trouble to make it, but I'm worried about tooth decay, so...

00:02:32.210 --> 00:02:34.930
Rina! I'm not making it for you!

00:02:34.930 --> 00:02:37.220
Tomorrow's Valentine's Day!

00:02:37.220 --> 00:02:39.510
Valentine's Day!

00:02:41.160 --> 00:02:42.470
Goodbye.

00:02:46.860 --> 00:02:51.500
It's done. My handmade chocolates, filled with my love.

00:02:52.390 --> 00:02:54.370
St. Valentine's Day.

00:02:54.370 --> 00:02:59.620
That's the day when girls give chocolates to boys, and confess their love to them.

00:02:59.620 --> 00:03:03.210
I, Hippo, won't allow that to happen!

00:03:03.650 --> 00:03:05.480
What is this thing!?

00:03:05.480 --> 00:03:06.800
First this, then this.

00:03:06.800 --> 00:03:08.540
And I'll finish everything up.

00:03:09.770 --> 00:03:14.010
My love-filled chocolate that I was going to give to Tarou-chan!

00:03:14.010 --> 00:03:16.560
What the hell are you doing, you stupid penguin!?

00:03:17.450 --> 00:03:18.980
I'm suffocating...

00:03:19.500 --> 00:03:22.810
By the way, do you know where Lucia went?

00:03:22.810 --> 00:03:25.910
Lucia-san? She went outside just now.

00:03:25.910 --> 00:03:27.840
I see. Thanks, Hippo.

00:03:28.320 --> 00:03:32.520
Oh yeah. I should warn you that eating too much chocolate can cause nosebleeds.

00:03:32.520 --> 00:03:33.710
Eat in moderation.

00:03:33.710 --> 00:03:37.230
Before I even get a nosebleed, I might die of suffocation.

00:03:44.440 --> 00:03:46.610
Who exactly does Kaito like?

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:49.080
Is it the mermaid of his memories?

00:03:49.740 --> 00:03:51.830
Or is it me?

00:03:54.880 --> 00:03:59.320
The more I think about it, the more I can't understand Kaito's heart.

00:04:00.030 --> 00:04:01.610
Then you shouldn't think about it.

00:04:03.140 --> 00:04:04.030
Rina.

00:04:04.620 --> 00:04:08.400
Are you still thinking about that, Lucia?

00:04:08.400 --> 00:04:09.970
But...

00:04:09.970 --> 00:04:14.070
Even if you think about it, you won't be able to understand another person's heart, will you?

00:04:15.710 --> 00:04:18.120
I know that, but...

00:04:18.120 --> 00:04:19.090
Just that...

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:23.290
Kaito doesn't know anything about mermaids.

00:04:23.290 --> 00:04:25.380
It's only a feeling he has.

00:04:25.380 --> 00:04:27.500
And the things in his mind will always be beautiful.

00:04:28.490 --> 00:04:34.180
Over this past year, he should have gotten a deeper impression of the real you.

00:04:34.180 --> 00:04:36.690
Embarrassing moments, shameful acts.

00:04:36.690 --> 00:04:38.420
Many of them were seen by Kaito.

00:04:38.420 --> 00:04:39.250
Yeah.

00:04:40.310 --> 00:04:43.210
And those moments belong to you, Lucia.

00:04:44.440 --> 00:04:45.540
And then?

00:04:45.540 --> 00:04:48.130
I wonder. I don't know anything more than this.

00:04:48.130 --> 00:04:49.690
Relationships are a nuisance.

00:04:49.690 --> 00:04:51.270
So I don't want them.

00:04:51.270 --> 00:04:53.150
Just because of that?

00:04:53.150 --> 00:04:54.450
That's it.

00:04:54.930 --> 00:04:55.880
See you later.

00:04:55.880 --> 00:04:59.140
It's almost time for "East and West Laughing Together" on TV.

00:04:59.140 --> 00:05:00.120
Excuse me.

00:05:00.120 --> 00:05:02.250
W-Wait a minute, Rina!

00:05:04.450 --> 00:05:08.710
Now I'm even more confused about Kaito's heart.

00:05:17.450 --> 00:05:21.720
The letter from my parents, which Aunt Yukie kept for me.

00:05:22.520 --> 00:05:23.680
Kaito,

00:05:23.680 --> 00:05:28.630
I wonder how old you'll be when you read this letter.

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:33.160
We first met you the morning after a terrible storm.

00:05:33.770 --> 00:05:37.070
A boy bathed in light on the sand.

00:05:37.840 --> 00:05:40.030
Kaito, that was you.

00:05:40.960 --> 00:05:45.450
The time we had with you as your parents were days overflowing with happiness.

00:05:46.000 --> 00:05:49.560
My dear who has matured over the years.

00:05:51.230 --> 00:05:52.250
Kaito.

00:05:52.250 --> 00:05:55.550
Your father and I really love you.

00:05:55.550 --> 00:05:59.380
Now and always, we love you.

00:05:59.380 --> 00:06:01.650
Please do not forget this.

00:06:02.200 --> 00:06:04.180
Love, Father and Mother.

00:06:05.660 --> 00:06:08.730
Just whose child am I exactly?

00:06:23.030 --> 00:06:24.240
Father...

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:36.460
What's the matter with you two?

00:06:36.460 --> 00:06:38.670
You look like you haven't had any sleep.

00:06:38.670 --> 00:06:41.410
It's because I had to remake the chocolates.

00:06:41.410 --> 00:06:44.550
Hippo ate all of the chocolates I made.

00:06:45.400 --> 00:06:46.280
Geez...

00:06:50.890 --> 00:06:52.840
Looks to me like she's deep in love.

00:06:52.840 --> 00:06:54.980
Hey, Kengo. Is that rumor true?

00:06:54.980 --> 00:06:59.020
Yeah. I saw Kaito filling the papers in the staff office.

00:06:59.020 --> 00:07:00.770
But is he going to quit this school?

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:02.320
Middle school is required, you know.

00:07:02.790 --> 00:07:04.910
There should be middle schools in Hawaii too, right?

00:07:04.910 --> 00:07:07.450
But can Kaito even speak English?

00:07:08.120 --> 00:07:10.990
Hey. What were you saying about Kaito?

00:07:10.990 --> 00:07:14.260
Well, it seems Kaito will be enrolling in an overseas surfing school.

00:07:14.260 --> 00:07:16.150
And he's going to be living in Hawaii.

00:07:16.150 --> 00:07:17.880
Overseas surfing school!?

00:07:17.880 --> 00:07:19.570
Isn't that right, Kengo?

00:07:20.100 --> 00:07:24.080
Yeah, but I didn't directly ask Kaito yet.

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:26.160
Lucia, didn't you hear about this?

00:07:26.160 --> 00:07:27.030
No...

00:07:27.030 --> 00:07:28.110
I see.

00:07:28.110 --> 00:07:30.210
You don't have to get so worked up.

00:07:30.210 --> 00:07:31.860
It might be a misunderstanding.

00:07:31.860 --> 00:07:32.840
That's right.

00:07:32.840 --> 00:07:36.410
If we know anything new, we'll tell you as soon as possible.

00:07:36.410 --> 00:07:37.260
See you.

00:07:38.320 --> 00:07:41.500
He's going to Hawaii? I'm jealous of Kaito.

00:07:41.910 --> 00:07:43.420
The things there must be huge.

00:07:43.420 --> 00:07:47.630
That's true. I heard that the junior high students there have "dynamite bodies".

00:07:47.630 --> 00:07:49.110
Stupid, I'm not talking about their breasts.

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:50.850
I meant the waves. The Big Waves!

00:07:50.850 --> 00:07:52.080
I see. I see.

00:07:52.590 --> 00:07:56.580
He's really mean not to have told his girlfriend about his overseas studies.

00:07:56.580 --> 00:07:58.690
I'm not his girlfriend yet.

00:07:58.690 --> 00:08:02.380
Then, this means the one Kaito really likes is the mermaid.

00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:10.380
Well, a beautiful mermaid is more attractive than homely Lucia is.

00:08:10.380 --> 00:08:14.880
Rina, you shouldn't say things that will rub salt in her wounds.

00:08:14.880 --> 00:08:17.560
Sorry. I accidentally said the truth.

00:08:21.320 --> 00:08:22.390
Say, did you hear?

00:08:22.390 --> 00:08:24.680
Kaito-kun is going to Hawaii for overseas studies.

00:08:24.680 --> 00:08:27.450
Really? Then, today's our last chance, isn't it?

00:08:27.450 --> 00:08:29.960
We absolutely have to give our chocolates to him!

00:08:41.670 --> 00:08:44.330
Kaito-kun, accept my chocolates!

00:08:44.330 --> 00:08:45.050
W-Wait...

00:08:45.400 --> 00:08:46.690
Mine too!

00:08:46.690 --> 00:08:47.680
Eat my chocolates!

00:08:48.270 --> 00:08:52.080
That's right. Kaito is everyone's idol.

00:08:53.150 --> 00:08:57.000
Just because I'm a mermaid... Just because I'm the one from his memories...

00:08:57.540 --> 00:08:59.480
He fell in love with me...

00:09:00.610 --> 00:09:04.660
That Kaito. If he eats so many chocolates, he'll get a nosebleed.

00:09:04.660 --> 00:09:05.490
Rina.

00:09:05.490 --> 00:09:07.200
Take this, Lucia.

00:09:07.200 --> 00:09:08.570
R-Rina.

00:09:08.570 --> 00:09:12.970
I'm grateful for your feelings, but I only think you as a good friend...

00:09:13.450 --> 00:09:14.190
Idiot!

00:09:14.190 --> 00:09:15.530
Don't get any funny ideas!

00:09:15.530 --> 00:09:17.940
Hanon made this for you.

00:09:17.940 --> 00:09:21.380
She said that you wouldn't have prepared any chocolates.

00:09:22.100 --> 00:09:26.070
But... It seems there wasn't a need for that.

00:09:28.350 --> 00:09:30.050
This chocolate isn't needed anymore.

00:09:30.730 --> 00:09:33.610
Isn't needed... Lucia?

00:09:34.050 --> 00:09:35.550
Hey, Lucia!

00:09:37.590 --> 00:09:38.770
Lucia.

00:09:39.680 --> 00:09:41.310
I'm sorry, but I can't accept your chocolates.

00:09:41.840 --> 00:09:43.270
Give them to those two instead.

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:47.260
Take care of them, Kengo, Daichi.

00:09:48.380 --> 00:09:53.500
I think it's a waste not to accept them. But since he was young, he wouldn't accept any chocolates.

00:09:53.500 --> 00:09:56.850
He always said he'd only accept it from the girl he likes.

00:09:56.850 --> 00:09:59.970
In that case, I'm okay with the chocolates from all of you.

00:09:59.970 --> 00:10:02.880
Me too. I don't have any reason to reject. I'll welcome them all.

00:10:08.010 --> 00:10:09.540
Why does this happen to me?

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:12.090
As I figured, we aren't good enough...

00:10:24.460 --> 00:10:27.590
That Lucia. Where did she run off to?

00:10:27.590 --> 00:10:29.530
I want to tell her something.

00:10:41.590 --> 00:10:47.590
Kaito... In the end, I should just be the mermaid from your memories.

00:10:48.540 --> 00:10:50.540
It's for the best, right?

00:10:51.160 --> 00:10:54.730
For both Kaito and me.

00:11:11.840 --> 00:11:17.380
On the surface, today is the day of giving presents to the one you love.

00:11:17.860 --> 00:11:20.760
Sara, what do you wish for?

00:11:20.760 --> 00:11:23.120
I'll grant you anything.

00:11:23.920 --> 00:11:24.860
Gaito...

00:11:25.500 --> 00:11:28.550
My wish, in the past and the present, will be only one thing.

00:11:29.630 --> 00:11:33.730
To be able to conquer the surface world,

00:11:33.730 --> 00:11:38.600
and to watch everyone in the world serve Gaito.

00:11:38.600 --> 00:11:41.060
That's my wish, Gaito.

00:11:42.010 --> 00:11:44.610
Don't be impatient, Sara.

00:11:44.610 --> 00:11:48.220
The day that you wish for is already drawing near.

00:11:50.790 --> 00:11:52.940
It looks that the annoying people have come.

00:11:53.590 --> 00:11:55.490
Well then, I shall excuse myself.

00:11:57.930 --> 00:11:58.740
Sara.

00:12:00.920 --> 00:12:04.200
Gaito-sama! How are you?

00:12:04.670 --> 00:12:06.290
Huh? This smell is...

00:12:06.610 --> 00:12:09.380
What exactly have you all come here for?

00:12:09.380 --> 00:12:11.160
Gaito-sama!

00:12:11.160 --> 00:12:14.290
These are filled with Dark Lover's love...

00:12:14.290 --> 00:12:16.970
...Valentine's Day chocolates!

00:12:16.970 --> 00:12:21.670
I wonder whose chocolate Gaito-sama will like.

00:12:21.670 --> 00:12:24.770
I'm rather confident with my sea urchin chocolates.

00:12:27.880 --> 00:12:30.170
I dislike sweets.

00:12:30.170 --> 00:12:31.240
Now, begone.

00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:46.760
The Valentine's Day chocolate that I put so much effort into making has become a waste.

00:12:46.760 --> 00:12:49.220
My specially-made sea urchin chocolate is...

00:12:49.220 --> 00:12:51.880
Suspicious... It's definitely suspicious!

00:12:51.880 --> 00:12:54.880
I caught a scent of a girl in Gaito's room.

00:12:55.340 --> 00:12:58.370
Eril, can you tell if she's a pretty girl by her smell?

00:12:58.370 --> 00:13:01.600
Of course! It's the smell of a fine, mature woman!

00:13:01.600 --> 00:13:08.440
Could it be that Gaito-sama has another lover other than the Black Beauty Sisters,

00:13:08.440 --> 00:13:12.020
because we always fail to capture the Mermaid Princesses?

00:13:13.240 --> 00:13:15.310
Gaito-sama has another lover?

00:13:15.310 --> 00:13:16.910
How can that be!?

00:13:17.250 --> 00:13:20.790
Everyone, now isn't the time to be fooling around.

00:13:20.790 --> 00:13:22.120
Let's take action!

00:13:26.250 --> 00:13:27.570
What's the matter, Rina?

00:13:28.500 --> 00:13:32.460
Hey, chocolates! How about a Valentine's Day chocolate of love?

00:13:32.460 --> 00:13:37.480
If you give this to a guy, he'll surely fall for you!

00:13:37.480 --> 00:13:38.820
That's right! That's right!

00:13:38.820 --> 00:13:41.680
How about a Valentine's Day chocolate?

00:13:42.390 --> 00:13:44.380
D-Dark Lovers!

00:13:44.380 --> 00:13:48.760
To be selling Valentine Day chocolates here...

00:13:48.760 --> 00:13:50.600
What on earth are they thinking?

00:13:52.300 --> 00:13:53.730
What's the matter, Maria?

00:13:53.730 --> 00:13:55.090
Say, Eril.

00:13:55.090 --> 00:14:00.860
There is a potion in the chocolates that causes the Mermaid Princesses to turn back into mermaids, right?

00:14:00.860 --> 00:14:03.500
Yeah! Isn't that an amazing idea!?

00:14:03.500 --> 00:14:08.870
After eating the chocolates, the Mermaid Princesses will reveal their true forms!

00:14:09.440 --> 00:14:11.420
Hold on a second.

00:14:11.420 --> 00:14:16.050
Valentine's Day is a day when girls give chocolates to guys, right?

00:14:16.050 --> 00:14:21.300
That means the guys will be eating it, not girls.

00:14:21.300 --> 00:14:24.330
It won't get into the mouths of the Mermaid Princesses.

00:14:25.960 --> 00:14:28.230
So you mean this was all for nothing!?

00:14:28.800 --> 00:14:32.890
If that's the case, we'll use force to make all of the girls eat these chocolates!

00:14:33.580 --> 00:14:35.950
What a sloppy plan.

00:14:35.950 --> 00:14:39.370
It's something that the Dark Lovers would do...

00:14:39.370 --> 00:14:43.330
But we can't let them continue with what they're doing now.

00:14:43.880 --> 00:14:46.190
It can't be helped. Let's take care of them.

00:14:46.190 --> 00:14:47.120
Yeah.

00:14:53.680 --> 00:14:55.960
Aqua Pearl Voice!

00:14:55.960 --> 00:14:58.040
Green Pearl Voice!

00:15:09.430 --> 00:15:10.700
Listen up, everyone.

00:15:10.700 --> 00:15:14.340
We're going to use force to make all of the girls eat these chocolates!

00:15:14.340 --> 00:15:15.890
We won't let you do that!

00:15:18.220 --> 00:15:24.020
On the day when girls give chocolates to the guys they love, it has an important meaning!

00:15:24.020 --> 00:15:28.810
Instead, you want to force people to eat the chocolates; I definitely won't forgive you!

00:15:28.810 --> 00:15:30.760
They appeared, the Mermaid Princesses.

00:15:30.760 --> 00:15:32.390
It's all according to our plan!

00:15:32.390 --> 00:15:33.720
Stop your nonsense.

00:15:33.720 --> 00:15:36.060
Your plan is just a bluff!

00:15:36.060 --> 00:15:40.910
Now, I'm going to send you and your love chocolates back to the sea without hesitation!

00:15:41.470 --> 00:15:44.380
Valentine Love Love Voice Live Start!

00:16:03.820 --> 00:16:05.610
Kaito, why are you here?

00:16:06.350 --> 00:16:09.850
"I'll be able to find you if I come to this beach."

00:16:09.850 --> 00:16:11.790
That's what I thought.

00:16:49.150 --> 00:16:52.110
Um... Kaito, are you...

00:16:52.850 --> 00:16:54.730
Are you really going to Hawaii?

00:16:54.730 --> 00:16:58.700
Yeah. I originally wanted you be the first to know,

00:16:58.700 --> 00:17:01.920
but it seems someone saw me filling out the transfer papers.

00:17:04.530 --> 00:17:08.840
Kaito, the thing that you once told me,

00:17:08.840 --> 00:17:10.030
do you remember that?

00:17:10.840 --> 00:17:12.260
What thing?

00:17:12.950 --> 00:17:14.760
The thing about mermaids.

00:17:14.760 --> 00:17:17.520
You said that one saved you.

00:17:17.520 --> 00:17:19.900
Ah, you're talking about that.

00:17:19.900 --> 00:17:22.600
Even if I want to forget, I couldn't do it.

00:17:22.600 --> 00:17:26.070
Because that mermaid wasn't an illusion.

00:17:32.700 --> 00:17:34.340
It's just as I thought.

00:17:34.340 --> 00:17:37.180
Kaito hasn't forgotten...

00:17:37.180 --> 00:17:39.410
...about the mermaid in his memories.

00:17:41.140 --> 00:17:42.780
What's the matter, Lucia?

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:44.000
Hey, Lucia!

00:17:45.050 --> 00:17:46.630
It's okay if you don't like me.

00:17:46.630 --> 00:17:49.570
Just like your memories of that mermaid,

00:17:49.570 --> 00:17:54.100
if I can leave an image in your memories...

00:17:54.100 --> 00:17:55.260
...just that...

00:17:56.040 --> 00:17:58.600
I'm okay with just that...

00:18:10.820 --> 00:18:11.920
S-Stop...

00:18:17.440 --> 00:18:18.900
Wait, Lucia!

00:18:18.900 --> 00:18:20.480
Let go of my hand, Kaito!

00:18:20.480 --> 00:18:21.790
I don't want this anymore...

00:18:22.230 --> 00:18:25.780
Lucia, I've got something I have to tell you, no matter what.

00:18:26.970 --> 00:18:29.430
Something you have to tell me no matter what?

00:18:30.180 --> 00:18:35.080
I want you to know the reason why I have to go to Hawaii.

00:18:35.800 --> 00:18:36.640
Kaito...

00:18:37.360 --> 00:18:39.560
Lucia, will you listen to me?

00:18:40.310 --> 00:18:41.240
Yeah.

00:18:53.290 --> 00:18:57.270
I... wasn't actually the child of my parents.

00:18:58.780 --> 00:19:03.460
I only know this because Aunt Yukie gave me a letter.

00:19:03.930 --> 00:19:07.710
I can't help that I want to find out who I really am.

00:19:08.310 --> 00:19:13.620
What does this have to do with you moving to Hawaii?

00:19:13.620 --> 00:19:18.140
Oh. To me, Hawaii has a special beach.

00:19:20.540 --> 00:19:25.250
Father was the first to teach me how to surf on the sea.

00:19:28.970 --> 00:19:32.340
I don't really know, but if I go to that beach,

00:19:32.340 --> 00:19:35.600
I have a feeling that I'll be able to find out who I am.

00:19:41.890 --> 00:19:43.820
Love Shower Pitch!

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:47.610
How about an encore?

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:52.440
We... We were too naïve!

00:19:56.340 --> 00:19:58.910
Do you now know of a girl's anger?

00:19:59.490 --> 00:20:02.100
If you eat too many chocolates, you're going to get a nosebleed.

00:20:02.990 --> 00:20:05.320
The sea remembers everything.

00:20:05.320 --> 00:20:08.020
Every person that has a bond with the sea...

00:20:08.990 --> 00:20:11.010
...will be changed by that bond.

00:20:11.560 --> 00:20:13.030
It'll tell you anything.

00:20:13.770 --> 00:20:14.970
As I thought.

00:20:16.450 --> 00:20:20.110
This kind of feeling can't be explained to anyone.

00:20:20.110 --> 00:20:23.290
But if it was you, I knew you'd be able to understand.

00:20:23.790 --> 00:20:26.420
That's what I felt.

00:20:29.090 --> 00:20:31.510
It was great to be able to speak with you today.

00:20:33.450 --> 00:20:35.380
Um... Kaito...

00:20:36.390 --> 00:20:39.300
This is my Valentine's Day chocolate.

00:20:39.930 --> 00:20:42.850
Although it's small and isn't handmade,

00:20:43.700 --> 00:20:45.100
I hope you can accept it.

00:20:47.610 --> 00:20:50.730
Thank you, Lucia. I'm really happy.

00:20:53.890 --> 00:20:57.450
Kaito... When will you come back from Hawaii?

00:20:57.450 --> 00:20:59.810
When I find my true self.

00:20:59.810 --> 00:21:01.330
I don't know when, though.

00:21:02.270 --> 00:21:03.870
You'll definitely return.

00:21:03.870 --> 00:21:06.600
I'll wait for you.

00:21:06.600 --> 00:21:08.580
I'll always, always' be waiting for you.

00:21:06.600 --> 00:21:08.580
I'll always, always' be waiting for you.

00:21:09.340 --> 00:21:12.990
Lucia is clumsy, gets angry often, and cries easily...

00:21:12.990 --> 00:21:15.510
You have shown me many sides of you.

00:21:16.180 --> 00:21:17.970
That's why I like you.

00:21:22.040 --> 00:21:25.190
Kaito, I'm... I'm...

00:21:25.950 --> 00:21:26.850
...happy.

00:21:27.590 --> 00:21:31.200
So, I'll definitely return!

00:21:46.730 --> 00:21:47.670
Kaito...

00:21:48.890 --> 00:21:49.930
Lucia...

00:21:49.930 --> 00:21:50.860
Kaito.

00:21:51.630 --> 00:21:56.330
Wherever you are, that is the place I will finally return to.

00:21:57.130 --> 00:21:58.200
Kaito...

00:22:04.010 --> 00:22:04.710
Lucia...

00:22:05.700 --> 00:22:06.570
Kaito...

00:23:51.010 --> 00:23:54.160
Mitsuki, I definitely won't forgive you.

00:23:54.160 --> 00:23:56.130
Sara, your black hair...

00:23:56.130 --> 00:23:58.250
Is that... my fault?

00:23:58.250 --> 00:24:00.360
I lost everything.

00:24:00.360 --> 00:24:03.090
My loved ones, my country, everything.

00:24:03.090 --> 00:24:05.940
Sara, if I can help you, I will...

00:24:05.940 --> 00:24:08.290
Of course, I'll have you compensate me.

00:24:08.290 --> 00:24:10.430
Only if you have the courage to do it.

00:24:11.090 --> 00:24:14.100
Next time on Mermaid Melody Pichi Pichi Pitch:

00:24:14.100 --> 00:24:15.690
Dark Invitation.

00:24:15.690 --> 00:24:20.150
Mitsuki, I'll invite you to come to my palace of darkness.
